<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Husedalen Four Waterfalls — Kinsarvik town–four waterfalls–Fjaoene return</name><desc>Walk from Kinsarvik centre along the town approach to Husemoen and the power station. Follow the red-T river path past Tveitafossen, the dam, Nyastølsfossen, Nykkjesøy and Nykkjesøyfossen to Fjaoene for the view of Søtefossen; return along the same complete route.

